      "title": "Timeline of the OpenAI accidental attack against Hugging Face",
      "url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/7/openai-timeline/",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49220609",
      "score": 409,
      "comments": 400,
      "author": "882542F3884314B",
      "published": "2026-08-08T10:57:44Z",
      "bullets": [
        "OpenAI automated web crawlers inadvertently launched an unintentional denial-of-service against Hugging Face repositories due to aggressive rate-unlimited scraping.",
        "High-concurrency data retrieval by LLM training pipelines can easily exceed target API limits and cause severe infrastructure outages.",
        "AI artifact hosts must enforce strict API rate limiting, egress throttling, and User-Agent filtering to defend against unthrottled crawler traffic."
      ]
    },
