      "bullets": [
        "Prioritize foundational design talks like Rich Hickey’s 'Simple Made Easy' to untangle architectural complexity from mere developer familiarity.",
        "Study distributed systems classics covering Raft consensus, vector clocks, and fault-tolerant state machine replication for reliable architectures.",
        "Review practical systems engineering presentations on eBPF profiling, garbage collection overhead, and tail-latency reduction strategies."
      ]
